6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path> </svg> <span class="text-xs text-white/50">Artist</span> </div> <a href="/browse?artist=Redice%20Studio" class="text-sm font-medium hover:text-[#913FE2] transition-colors">Redice Studio</a> </div>  </div> </div> </div> <!-- Genres (Desktop) --> <div class="hidden lg:flex max-w-full gap-2 flex-wrap"> <a href="/browse?genres=action" class="inline-flex flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/5 rounded-md border border-white/5 hover:border-[#913FE2] hover:text-[#913FE2] transition-all"> Action </a><a href="/browse?genres=adventure" class="inline-flex flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/5 rounded-md border border-white/5 hover:border-[#913FE2] hover:text-[#913FE2] transition-all"> Adventure </a><a href="/browse?genres=comedy" class="inline-flex flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/5 rounded-md border border-white/5 hover:border-[#913FE2] hover:text-[#913FE2] transition-all"> Comedy </a><a href="/browse?genres=fantasy" class="inline-flex flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/5 rounded-md border border-white/5 hover:border-[#913FE2] hover:text-[#913FE2] transition-all"> Fantasy </a> </div> <!-- Report data mistake (Desktop only — mobile gets it inside DescriptionModal) --> <div class="hidden lg:block mt-1"> <astro-island uid="Z1Gn6Ee" prefix="r27" component-url="/_astro/ReportSeriesDataButton.BstZ9Dt8.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.ZWAiH0lX.js" props="{&quot;seriesId&quot;:[0,2161],&quot;seriesTitle&quot;:[0,&quot;Emperor of Solo Play&quot;],&quot;variant&quot;:[0,&quot;inline&quot;]}" ssr client="idle" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ReportSeriesDataButton&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}"></astro-island> </div> </div> <!-- Right Column --> <div class="w-full mt-3 lg:mt-0"> <!-- Main Info Card --> <article class="bg-[#1C1924] rounded-md px-3 py-4 lg:p-8"> <h1 class="text-xl lg:text-[32px] font-semibold leading-tight"> Emperor of Solo Play </h1> <!-- Alternative Titles & Popularity --> <div id="alt-container" class="flex items-start gap-3 mt-3 text-xs">  <p id="alt-titles" class="text-white/50 leading-relaxed line-clamp-1"> 孤独《ソロプレイ》の帝王 • 單刷王者 • 솔플의 제왕 • ราชาแห่งโซโล่เพลเยอร์ • 单刷之王 • The King of Soloplay • The Emperor of Solo Play </p> </div> <!-- Description --> <div class="mt-3 relative"> <div id="description-text" class="text-sm lg:text-base font-light text-white/80 leading-relaxed prose prose-invert max-w-full line-clamp-3 lg:cursor-pointer"><p>The launch of the virtual reality game Warlord in the year 2035 changed the world.</p><p>Ahn Jaehyun was one of many who sought to change his fate within it.</p><p>But the price of devoting his entire life to the game was betrayal by the very comrades he trusted the most.</p><p>Having lost everything because of that betrayal, Jaehyun is given one more chance to start over.</p><p>"I'm never playing with others again. Whether I win or lose, I'll do it all on my own, and show them exactly what that means."</p><p>While others roll dice to split the loot, Jaehyun is the one who takes it all for himself.</p><p>And so begins his thrilling, ruthless, solo-kill gaming life!</p></div> <!-- Desktop: Expand/collapse button --> <div class="hidden lg:flex justify-end mt-2"> <button id="expand-description" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#913FE2] text-xs font-medium px-2 py-1 rounded hover:bg-white/5 cursor-pointer transition-colors"> <span id="expand-text">Show more</span> <svg id="expand-icon" class="w-3 h-3 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path> </svg> </button> </div> <!-- Mobile: Fullscreen modal --> <astro-island uid="23Tqxt" prefix="r28" component-url="/_astro/DescriptionModal.Dt6KPC77.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.ZWAiH0lX.js" props="{&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Emperor of Solo Play&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;&lt;p&gt;The launch of the virtual reality game Warlord in the year 2035 changed the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ahn Jaehyun was one of many who sought to change his fate within it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But the price of devoting his entire life to the game was betrayal by the very comrades he trusted the most.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Having lost everything because of that betrayal, Jaehyun is given one more chance to start over.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\&quot;I&#39;m never playing with others again. Whether I win or lose, I&#39;ll do it all on my own, and show them exactly what that means.\&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;While others roll dice to split the loot, Jaehyun is the one who takes it all for himself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And so begins his thrilling, ruthless, solo-kill gaming life!&lt;/p&gt;&quot;],&quot;alternativeTitles&quot;:[0,&quot;孤独《ソロプレイ》の帝王 • 單刷王者 • 솔플의 제왕 • ราชาแห่งโซโล่เพลเยอร์ • 单刷之王 • The King of Soloplay • The Emperor of Solo Play&quot;],&quot;popularityRank&quot;:[0,null],&quot;coverUrl&quot;:[0,&quot;https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/emperor-of-solo-play.0d7530.webp&quot;],&quot;rating&quot;:[0,8.24375],&quot;viewCount&quot;:[0],&quot;bookmarkCount&quot;:[0,17941],&quot;status&quot;:[0,&quot;ongoing&quot;],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;manhwa&quot;],&quot;author&quot;:[0,&quot;Dedart&quot;],&quot;artist&quot;:[0,&quot;Redice Studio&quot;],&quot;genres&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Action&quot;],&quot;slug&quot;:[0,&quot;action&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,4],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Adventure&quot;],&quot;slug&quot;:[0,&quot;adventure&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,7],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Comedy&quot;],&quot;slug&quot;:[0,&quot;comedy&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,16],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Fantasy&quot;],&quot;slug&quot;:[0,&quot;fantasy&quot;]}]]],&quot;chapterCount&quot;:[0,88],&quot;seriesId&quot;:[0,2161],&quot;userRating&quot;:[0]}" ssr client="id